%% alt: A user works with a host app or lead agent. It uses MCP to call tools and read resources on a CRM server and a documents server. It uses A2A to delegate a task to a remote agent run by another team or vendor. That remote agent uses MCP to reach its own payments server.
flowchart TB
  U[User]:::human --> H[Host app or lead agent]:::model
  H -->|MCP| T1[MCP server: CRM]:::tool
  H -->|MCP| T2[MCP server: documents]:::tool
  H -->|A2A: delegate a task| R[Remote agent<br/>another team or vendor]:::untrusted
  R -->|MCP| T3[MCP server: payments]:::tool
